{"code":0,"data":{"title":"上传安全报告","content":"<h2 id=\"s-fcfcis8o\">app.upload.safety.report</h2><p>功能描述：应用创建、更新上传安全报告</p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-60501153\">环境信息</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\"><p><strong>环境</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"413\" style=\"width: 413px\"><p><strong>HTTPS地址</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>正式环境</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"413\" style=\"width: 413px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>https://developer-api.vivo.com.cn/router/rest</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-60475865\">公共参数</h2><p>调用任何一个API都必须传入的参数，目前支持的公共参数有：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\"><p><strong>是否必须</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"567\" style=\"width: 567px\"><p><strong>参数描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"567\" style=\"width: 567px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>接口名称：app.upload.safety.report</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>access_key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"567\" style=\"width: 567px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>申请API传包服务成功后vivo开放平台分配开发者接入的access_key。</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/326\">具体获取说明</a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>timestamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"567\" style=\"width: 567px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>时间戳（毫秒）示例：1567945333425，允许客户端请求最大时间误差为20分钟。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>format</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"567\" style=\"width: 567px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>响应格式。默认值：json。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>v</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"567\" style=\"width: 567px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>API协议版本，可选值：1.0。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign_method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"567\" style=\"width: 567px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>签名的摘要算法，可选值为：hmac。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"567\" style=\"width: 567px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>API输入参数签名结果，<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/327#w1-84225273\">签名算法参照下面的介绍</a>。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>target_app_key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"567\" style=\"width: 567px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>被调用的目标key，可选值：developer</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-60457097\">请求参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"178\" style=\"width: 178px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>请求协议</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"191,129,718\" style=\"width: 1038px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>HTTPS&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"178\" style=\"width: 178px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>请求方式</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"191,129,718\" style=\"width: 1038px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>POST</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"178\" style=\"width: 178px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"191\" style=\"width: 191px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>是否必填</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"718\" style=\"width: 718px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>字段说明</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"178\" style=\"width: 178px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>packageName</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"191\" style=\"width: 191px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"718\" style=\"width: 718px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>应用或者游戏包名</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"178\" style=\"width: 178px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>file</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"191\" style=\"width: 191px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>multipart/form-data</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"718\" style=\"width: 718px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传的文件</p><p>请上传pdf格式文件，不超过10M</p><p>请在【<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://www.beian.gov.cn/portal/topicDetail?id=79&amp;token=d2e654b4-770c-4e57-ac0b-bbf11fb522a9\">具有舆论属性或社会动员能力的互联网信息服务安全评估规定</a>】中查看所需提交安全报告的APP类别， 登录【<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://www.beian.gov.cn/\">全国互联网安全管理服务平台</a>】填写并下载安全评估报告提交。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-60438505\">响应参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"137\" style=\"width: 137px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\"><p><strong>是否返回</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"355\" style=\"width: 355px\"><p><strong>字段说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>code</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"137\" style=\"width: 137px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>int</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"355\" style=\"width: 355px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回状态码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>subCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"137\" style=\"width: 137px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"355\" style=\"width: 355px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请求子返回码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>msg</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"137\" style=\"width: 137px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"355\" style=\"width: 355px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>结果描述</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>data</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"137\" style=\"width: 137px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Object</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"355\" style=\"width: 355px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传后的文件信息。上传失败时不返回此参数。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>packageName</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"137\" style=\"width: 137px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"355\" style=\"width: 355px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>包名</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>serialnumber</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"137\" style=\"width: 137px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"355\" style=\"width: 355px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>文件上传成功的后流水号</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-60421354\">响应示例</h2><pre><code>成功示例：\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":0,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"成功\"，\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"subCode\"&nbsp;:&nbsp;\"0\",\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"data\":&nbsp;{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"packageName\":&nbsp;\"com.test.test\",\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"serialnumber\":&nbsp;\"210c5cbc67fdded24245eec7ff5d605c\"\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}\n}\n\n失败示例：\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":10001,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"签名校验失败\"\n}\n\n业务失败示例\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":0,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"subCode\"&nbsp;:&nbsp;\"13001\",\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"上传的文件不存在，上传失败\"\n}</code></pre><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-60401778\"><